{%- comment -%}
  Default Structure pillar (light, text left) when no blocks configured.
{%- endcomment -%}

<article class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar--equal hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar--reverse">
  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__media">
    {% render 'hp-science-media',
      show_placeholder: true,
      placeholder_label: 'Structure / collagen image / animation',
      min_height: 520
    %}
  </div>

  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__panel" style="background: {{ panel_bg | default: '#fcfaf2' }};">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-num">Pillar 03</p>
    <h3 class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-title" style="color: #a8724a;">Structure</h3>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">Collagen. The protein that makes skin bounce back. Production declines from 25 onwards. A peptide complex signals the biology to support what's slowing.</p>
    <hr class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__rule" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">Each peptide targets a specific biological function: synthesis, repair, inflammation control, moisture signalling. Simultaneously. Because the signals are interconnected.</p>
    <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-wrap">
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-value" style="color: #a8724a;">+132.4%*</p>
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-label">Collagen Production</p>
    </div>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__footnote" style="color: {{ footnote_color | default: '#888888' }};">* Increase in Collagen 1 Levels in NHDF Cells Treated with SKIN LONGEVITY SYSTEM 3.</p>
  </div>
</article>
